STE-36: Implement Akoya polling sync for FDX accounts + transactions

Core API:
- /internal/sync-trigger now forwards Akoya connection metadata,
  vault access token, and linked account mappings to the ingestion
  service, eliminating extra round-trips.

Akoya Ingestion Service:
- Replace StubAkoyaClient with AkoyaFdxHttpClient that calls real
  Akoya FDX endpoints (/fdx/v1/accounts and /transactions).
- Fix sandbox FDX base URL (was incorrectly pointing to IDP).
- Add optional AKOYA_FDX_BASE_URL override.
- Map Akoya external account IDs to local Steward account IDs using
  the linkedAccounts mapping forwarded from the core API.
- Add error handling: on Akoya 401/403 update connection status to
  "needsreauth", on other errors to "error".
- Record sync events via core API and return partial/completed status.

Co-Authored-By: Paperclip <noreply@paperclip.ing>
